{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#card-zh","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回收站插件：它在会话行操作区加入移入回收站按钮，并在设置中提供回收站页面。插件通过 Host 路由移动会话日志目录、整理工作区关联和投影缓存，再通知侧栏更新；还可恢复原目录与工作区状态，或永久删除单个条目、清空回收站。移入前会检查会话及其子会话是否仍有活动。适合希望先保留误删会话、之后再决定恢复或清除的 DSH 用户。默认使用 ~/.dsh 数据目录，也可通过 DSH_HOME 指定；无需 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-92","index.js:511-566","client.js:546-582"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#card-en","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Session Trash adds a recoverable bin to the DSH web client. Move session families from the sidebar, then restore them or permanently clear them in Settings. It checks for active work before moving sessions. Data stays under ~/.dsh or DSH_HOME; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-92","index.js:511-566","client.js:546-582"]}
