{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#feature-1","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 的功能「移入回收站」：点击会话行尾按钮并确认后，插件会把会话及其子会话目录移入回收站，并从工作区列表中移除。会话仍在运行时，操作会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:160-180","index.js:511-566"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#feature-2","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 的功能「恢复会话」：在设置的回收站页面选择恢复后，条目目录会移回原位置，并尝试重新关联原工作区及归档、置顶状态；页面随后刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:350-388","index.js:590-659"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#feature-3","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 的功能「永久清除」：在回收站条目上先点击彻底删除，再次确认后删除该条目目录；清空操作也需第二次确认。被清除的会话无法从此回收站恢复。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:300-340","client.js:399-440","index.js:661-715"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#feature-4","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 的功能「查看回收站」：打开设置中的回收站页面后，插件列出条目标题、来源工作区、会话数量、移入时间和占用空间，并显示当前条目总数与大小。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:350-367","client.js:442-488","index.js:470-508"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#caveat-1","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 使用前须知：彻底删除或清空会移除本机回收站目录中的会话文件，插件本身没有后续恢复入口（见 index.js:661-715）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:661-715"]}
{"unit_id":"qyy2005__dsh-session-trash#caveat-2","repo":"qyy2005/dsh-session-trash","commit":"bc135722dfbb1e467cda76db5bfeb77875b5686c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Session Trash 使用前须知：回收站与会话数据写入 DSH_HOME 指定的数据目录；未设置时使用用户目录下的 ~/.dsh（见 index.js:101-115）。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:101-115"]}
